  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 506.02 Removal of Processed Recyclable Materials",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-10-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 506.02 Removal of Processed Recyclable Materials. To comply with Env-Sw 1006.02(e), all processed recyclable materials shall be removed to an authorized facility and not remain at the closing facility under any claim of a permit exemption pursuant to Env-Sw 302.03.\n\nSource. #5172, eff 7-1-91; ss by #6535, INTERIM, eff 7-1-97, EXPIRES: 10-29-97; ss by #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 500); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2206.02); ss by #10596, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14025, eff 8-1-24",
